1
00:00:00,831 --> 00:00:03,821
(Leonard:)You know, I'm really starting
to not like this guy.

2
00:00:04,668 --> 00:00:05,728
(Penny:)What is your problem?

3
00:00:05,903 --> 00:00:09,433
Do you use up your thinking at work
and have none left for home?

4
00:00:09,606 --> 00:00:11,006
(Raj:)I don't know.

5
00:00:11,175 --> 00:00:13,545
(Leonard:)It's hard sometimes.

6
00:00:13,711 --> 00:00:15,541
(Leonard:)Everywhere you go, guys hit on you.

7
00:00:15,713 --> 00:00:17,773
(Leonard:)Even if I'm standing right there.

8
00:00:17,948 --> 00:00:21,608
(Leonard:)And they're all taller than me.
Why is everyone taller than me?

9
00:00:22,519 --> 00:00:24,919
(Leonard:)You know what, this is all in my head.

10
00:00:25,089 --> 00:00:26,519
(Leonard:)It's my problem, not yours.

11
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,390
(Penny:)Leonard, why do you always do this?

12
00:00:28,559 --> 00:00:31,389
Listen to me. You are the one I'm with.
You know I love you.

13
00:00:31,562 --> 00:00:34,262
(Penny:)So will you please relax
because you're driving me crazy.

14
00:00:41,205 --> 00:00:44,235
(Leonard:)You know, that's the first time you ever said
that you love me.

15
00:00:46,143 --> 00:00:47,573
(Leonard:)Yeah.

16
00:00:51,548 --> 00:00:56,018
(Leonard:)We're just supposed to pretend
it's not a big deal?

